WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:05.208
(woman screaming)
(man grunting)

00:00:05.697 --> 00:00:07.309
- (splutters) Oh, come on!

00:00:07.309 --> 00:00:08.765
(chuckling)

00:00:08.765 --> 00:00:11.932
(lighthearted jingle)

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.830
- Hey, Legal Eagles, D. James Stone here,

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.460
teaching you how to think like a lawyer.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.710
Last week we covered the
