00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.220
Today, we're covering the second half,

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.010
including the entire divorce trial.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:26.220
So let's dig in, remember
to like and subscribe,

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:29.160
and be sure to comment in
